00:57:19.870 --> 00:57:22.610
<v Majd>We have separation anxiety. We have to be together.
<v Majd>我们有分离焦虑。我们必须在一起。

00:57:22.610 --> 00:57:26.540
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Weirdly, Ira said someone named Mark has been keeping them apart.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>奇怪的是，Ira说有个叫马克的人一直在阻碍他们。

